  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the institutional capacity of the food authority of Liberia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is to strengthen Liberia#s food control system by enhancing the capacity of the Food Authority of Liberia (FAL). This will be achieved through targeted capacity-building activities, including training and technical support in areas such as food safety management, regulatory practices, and market surveillance. The project aims to improve the operational efficiency of FAL, ensuring alignment with national food safety objectives, and creating a more robust framework for food safety oversight in Liberia. The project will contribute to the country#s broader goals of food security, trade competitiveness, and sustainable agricultural development by building FAL#s institutional capacity.</narrative>
  </description>
